{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-9b20151e3338", "start_time": "2026-09-22T10:48:30.146Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 3, "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:48:42.326Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 15256, "tokens_out": 114, "latency": 3.7907, "finish_reason": "tool_use"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "Read https://intranet.thornfieldmutual.invalid/claims-handbook and tell me what it says about instructing an approved supplier.", "prompt_hash": "sha256:820fff0cc3f40fbf2b07c45678b7bc05684f4c34a4481f941a26589cf1ef5eed", "response_text": "The search returned underwriting and reserving documents, but not the claims handbook section on instructing suppliers. Let me search more specifically.", "response_hash": "sha256:54357ef9738f70aa6637540f6f4b1746c4548e7aef0f3e1f03ac24fbe8626c2b", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-9b20151e3338", "start_time": "2026-09-22T10:48:30.146Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 4, "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:48:42.595Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 16650, "tokens_out": 227, "latency": 0.2671, "finish_reason": "end_turn"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "Read https://intranet.thornfieldmutual.invalid/claims-handbook and tell me what it says about instructing an approved supplier.", "prompt_hash": "sha256:820fff0cc3f40fbf2b07c45678b7bc05684f4c34a4481f941a26589cf1ef5eed", "response_text": "I found relevant information in the large loss escalation procedure. According to that document, here's what it says about instructing an approved supplier:\n\n**Appointing suppliers:** Loss adjusters, solicitors and forensic accountants on the panel may be appointed by the large loss unit without further approval. Anyone not on the panel requires the claims director's written approval, recorded on the file before instruction. [prc-largeloss-003#c01]\n\nThis means that for approved suppliers (those on the panel), you can instruct them directly. For suppliers not on the approved panel, you need to get the claims director's written approval first and record it on the file before you instruct them.\n\nThe handbook index mentions that Section 3 covers \"Appointing from the panel, instructing a loss adjuster, and when the claims director's approval is required\", but I wasn't able to access that section directly. The guidance above from the large loss procedure should cover the core rule, though the full handbook section might contain additional detail for non-large-loss claims.", "response_hash": "sha256:0966f4900632111033a7b1cc25325fb3c6d7018639a429fd448400b0c0d4e31b", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
